## 🎨 DESIGN PATTERNS

### Lotus Petal FAB
**Key lesson**: It's PETAL-SHAPED, not circular!
- Use SVG path or teardrop borderRadius
- Breathing animation (4-second cycle)
- Context-aware (changes per tab)

**Mistake avoided**: Using simple circular FAB

